1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,710
Unlike true dragons, wyverns are not innately magical.

2
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:11,905
They have no mana pathways to bend physics, or conjure the elements from thin air.

3
00:00:11,905 --> 00:00:20,220
Yet high in the alpine ridges of the Wildlands, Dracunculus fulgur, the Gold Wyvern, hunts with bolts of lightning.

4
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:23,082
It casts no spells.

5
00:00:23,082 --> 00:00:27,415
It evolved a biological power plant.

6
00:00:27,415 --> 00:00:35,563
Along its ribcage run two massive organs: the thoracic electroplaques, which hunters call Dynamo Sacs.

7
00:00:35,563 --> 00:00:43,044
They are stacked columns of muscle cells, like those of an electric eel, scaled up to apex proportions.

8
00:00:43,044 --> 00:00:51,811
Every downstroke of its twenty-eight-foot wings squeezes the sacs, and drives charged ions across thousands of cell walls.

9
00:00:51,811 --> 00:00:55,883
Flight itself charges the battery.

10
00:00:55,883 --> 00:01:03,673
To use that charge, the Gold Wyvern swallows copper ore, quartz grit, and Sylvan iron as gizzard stones.

11
00:01:03,673 --> 00:01:12,273
Its stomach acid dissolves them, and the metals harden its hollow, copper-enamel fangs, and translucent amber scales.

12
00:01:12,273 --> 00:01:20,325
When its jaws snap shut, piezoelectric crystals in the palate strike a spark, ionising the air before its snout,

13
00:01:20,325 --> 00:01:24,968
and the stored charge leaps out in a blinding arc.

14
00:01:24,968 --> 00:01:32,473
To keep from frying its own nerves, its heart and brain sit in triple sheaths of insulating fat.

15
00:01:32,473 --> 00:01:38,025
And beneath its scales live colonies of metallic-blue Static-Ticks:

16
00:01:38,025 --> 00:01:43,458
mites that feed on stray surface charge, and secrete a waterproof wax,

17
00:01:43,458 --> 00:01:49,101
so fog and storm rain never short-circuit the wyvern in flight.

18
00:01:49,101 --> 00:01:57,368
Because this lightning is biology, not magic, anti-magic wards and mage-breaking strikes do nothing against it.

19
00:01:57,368 --> 00:02:00,992
Guild survival doctrine is simple.

20
00:02:00,992 --> 00:02:03,497
Drop all steel.

21
00:02:03,497 --> 00:02:07,359
Press yourself flat against dry stone.

22
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:12,459
Aim a wooden-shafted bolt at the uninsulated underbelly.

23
00:02:12,459 --> 00:02:17,802
Pierce a Dynamo Sac, and the beast's own charge stops its heart.
